    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNIE: But where's Cynthia? We have to get going, don't we?\nBRENDA A: Calm and collect, Annie. She said she had a surprise.\nELISE: How is this? Is this heaven?\nANNIE: You are so gorgeous. It's lovely.",
      "ANNIE: What if I found ‘someone else? What if, I mean, maybe, isn't that possible?\nCATHERINE: Oh, honey. You're forty-six. A woman your age has a greater chance of being slaughtered by a psychopath.\nCATHERINE: Didn't you go to school with her?",
      "GUNILLA: Elise.\nELISE: Gunilla.\nGUNILLA: What a tragedy.\nELISE: Poor Cynthia.",
      "ANNIE: I knew you'd be here.\nELISE: Annie. It's been too long. {sees Annie's pearls) You're wearing our pearls.\nBRENDA: Hi. Brenda. Brenda Morelli?\nANNIE & ELISE: Oh my God...",
      "LESLIE: Babe?\nLESLIE: Oh my God.\nANNIE: Oh my God."
    ]
